  "slug": "apple-chicken-brine",
  "name": "Apple Chicken Brine",
  "recipe_type": "soup",
  "brief_description": "This apple chicken brine recipe starts with veggie broth and apple juice plus salt, pepper, and herbes de Provence. Brine a whole chicken, then roast.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine vegetable broth, apple juice, kosher salt, black pepper, and herbes de Provence in a pot; bring to a boil, stirring until salt is completely dissolved. Cool completely, transfer to a container or resealable plastic bag, and refrigerate until chilled."
    }
  ],
